# ThreeTrianglesSharingVertex.obj - converted from CGAL 6.2's own PMP_Mesh_repair test fixture
# (PMP_Mesh_repair/test/PMP_Mesh_repair/data-repair/three_triangles_sharing_a_vertex.off, used by
# test_pmp_manifoldness.cpp's test_pinched_triangles<>() case). Trivial 7-point/3-triangle
# geometry, converted here for licensing-safety reasons (see the assistant's note accompanying
# this file) rather than redistributing the .off directly.
#
# Three disconnected triangle fans - (1,2,5), (2,3,4), (6,7,2) below - meeting ONLY at vertex 2
# (0,0,0), no shared edges: a 3-way non-manifold vertex, one step past RepairMeshTest.obj's 2-way
# bowtie. duplicate_non_manifold_vertices() should report 2 vertices created here (N-1 splits for
# an N-way fan) to turn it into 3 separate manifold vertices at the same position.

mtllib ThreeTrianglesSharingVertex.mtl
usemtl mat_1

v 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
v 1.000000 0.000000 0.000000
v 2.000000 0.000000 0.000000
v 2.000000 1.000000 0.000000
v 0.000000 1.000000 0.000000
v 0.000000 -1.000000 0.000000
v 2.000000 -1.000000 0.000000

f 1 2 5
f 2 3 4
f 6 7 2
